  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "商學理論與應用",
    "sub_ename": "BUSINESS THEORY AND APPLICATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程之重點，乃在於培養學生針對產業的實務發展與應用，透過結合課程所學之商業理論，有效地協助學生深入探討並發掘其研究問題，並為日後研究分析課程做準備。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to cultivate the students' research abilities of finding research questions/topics effectively with respect to the industrial development and application in business practice. This course also combines with the theories learned from the previous courses in order to prepare for the future courses of research design and research analysis.",
